<title>SRI LANKA: John Keells nine-month net up 7.5 pct.</title>
<headline>John Keells nine-month net up 7.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of John Keells Holdings Ltd, for the nine months to 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			9 months 1996	 9 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	  4,358.19     vs     4,212.56</p>
<p>    Net profit	  220.02     vs	 204.74</p>
<p>    Tax		   144.40     vs	 101.90</p>
<p>NOTE - John Keells Holdings Ltd is one of three diversified blue-chip holding companies listed in Colombo. The group consolidates accounts with about 60 subsidiaries, of which 12 are listed.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
